IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `snap-core`

-- THE FISCAL YEAR 2027 FIGURES that section 2017 reads: the maximum monthly allotments and the minimum monthly allotment.
-- SOURCE: fna-snap-cola-fy2027.txt, the USDA's cost-of-living page (INPUT DATA, not statute), effective 1 October 2026 to 30 September 2027.
-- The Act does not state these figures: it says the allotment is the cost of the thrifty food plan, which section 2012(u) leaves to the
-- Secretary. Every figure below is the USDA's, parsed from the page by work/gen_cola.py, and every one is replaceable: the functions
-- of section 2017 take the cost as an INPUT, and these tables only supply it for fiscal year 2027.
-- A column order is the page's: 48 States and DC, Alaska urban, Alaska rural 1, Alaska rural 2, Guam, Hawaii, Virgin Islands.

§ `s 2017 -- fiscal year 2027 figures from the USDA page`

-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:59 | Table 1. Maximum Monthly Allotment
