@ref USDA FY 2027 COLA, Table 1 Maximum Monthly Allotment, household sizes 1 to 8 (each row a TOTAL for that many people) (src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:59-68)
-- ROWS 1 TO 8 ARE TOTALS: the monthly maximum allotment for a household of exactly that many members.
-- The page's "9-17" and "18+" rows are NOT head-counts; they are the two constants after this table.
`s 2017 the maximum monthly allotments for household sizes 1 to 8, fiscal year 2027` MEANS
    `Annual table` OF 2027, "Maximum monthly allotment, a total for a household of exactly the stated size, 1 October 2026 to 30 September 2027 (USDA)",
        LIST
            --                                         48 States, AkUrban, AkRural1, AkRural2, Guam, Hawaii, VI
            ( `Table row` OF 1, (`Dollars by area` OF 306, 392, 499, 608, 452, 496, 394) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 2, (`Dollars by area` OF 562, 718, 916, 1115, 829, 910, 723) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 3, (`Dollars by area` OF 808, 1032, 1316, 1602, 1191, 1307, 1039) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 4, (`Dollars by area` OF 1023, 1306, 1666, 2027, 1507, 1655, 1315) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 5, (`Dollars by area` OF 1217, 1555, 1982, 2413, 1794, 1969, 1565) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 6, (`Dollars by area` OF 1463, 1868, 2382, 2900, 2156, 2367, 1880) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 7, (`Dollars by area` OF 1616, 2064, 2632, 3204, 2382, 2615, 2078) )
          , ( `Table row` OF 8, (`Dollars by area` OF 1841, 2352, 2999, 3650, 2714, 2979, 2367) )

-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:69 | 9-17 | $225 peradditionalperson | $287 peradditionalperson | $366 peradditionalperson | $446 peradditionalperson | $331 peradditionalperson | $364 peradditionalperson | $289 peradditionalperson
@ref USDA FY 2027 COLA, Table 1 Maximum Monthly Allotment, the "9-17" row (src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:69)
-- NOT A TOTAL: dollars PER PERSON for each member of the household ABOVE 8, for a household of 9 to 17 members.
-- A household of 9 to 17 members gets the 8-member total plus this figure for each member above 8.
`s 2017 the maximum allotment per additional person above 8, fiscal year 2027` MEANS
    `Dollars by area` OF 225, 287, 366, 446, 331, 364, 289

-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:70 | 18+ | $3,887 | $4,965 | $6,331 | $7,705 | $5,729 | $6,289 | $4,997
@ref USDA FY 2027 COLA, Table 1 Maximum Monthly Allotment, the "18+" row (src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:70)
-- A TOTAL, for a household of 18 or more members (a cap: it does not grow with a further member).
`s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment for a household of 18 or more, fiscal year 2027` MEANS
    `Dollars by area` OF 3887, 4965, 6331, 7705, 5729, 6289, 4997

-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:149 | Table 1. Minimum Monthly Allotment
-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:150 | Household Size | 48 States and District of Columbia | Alaska(Urban) | Alaska(Rural 1) | Alaska(Rural 2) | Guam | Hawaii | Virgin Islands
-- src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:151 | 1-2 | $25 | $31 | $40 | $49 | $36 | $40 | $32
@ref USDA FY 2027 COLA, Table 1 Minimum Monthly Allotment, household sizes 1-2 (src:fna-snap-cola-fy2027:149-151)
-- A TOTAL, for a household of one or two members (the same figure for both).
`s 2017 the minimum monthly allotment for a household of 1 or 2, fiscal year 2027` MEANS
    `Dollars by area` OF 25, 31, 40, 49, 36, 40, 32

-- Which of the seven columns applies to a place.
GIVEN `the figures` IS A `Dollars by area`
      `where the household lives` IS AN Area
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 2017 the figure for the area` MEANS
    CONSIDER `where the household lives`
        WHEN `the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia` THEN `the figures`'s `in the 48 contiguous States and the District of Columbia`
        WHEN `Alaska, urban` THEN `the figures`'s `in Alaska, urban`
        WHEN `Alaska, rural 1` THEN `the figures`'s `in Alaska, rural 1`
        WHEN `Alaska, rural 2` THEN `the figures`'s `in Alaska, rural 2`
        WHEN Guam THEN `the figures`'s `in Guam`
        WHEN Hawaii THEN `the figures`'s `in Hawaii`
        WHEN `the Virgin Islands of the United States` THEN `the figures`'s `in the Virgin Islands of the United States`

-- The row of the table for exactly this many members, if the table has one (sizes 1 to 8).
GIVEN `the household size` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `Table row`
`s 2017 the table row for size` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN r YIELD r's `household size` EQUALS `the household size`) (`s 2017 the maximum monthly allotments for household sizes 1 to 8, fiscal year 2027`'s `the rows`)
        WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
        WHEN r FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST r

-- THE MAXIMUM MONTHLY ALLOTMENT, FISCAL YEAR 2027, as the USDA publishes it, for a household of this size in this place.
-- 1 to 8 members: the row. 9 to 17: the 8-member total plus the per-person figure for each member above 8.
-- 18 or more: the cap. Anything else (no members, a fraction of a member) has no figure: NOTHING.
GIVEN `the household size` IS A NUMBER
      `where the household lives` IS AN Area
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment, fiscal year 2027` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the household size` LESS THAN 1 THEN NOTHING
        IF NOT (FLOOR `the household size` EQUALS `the household size`) THEN NOTHING
        IF `the household size` AT MOST 8 THEN
            CONSIDER `s 2017 the table row for size` `the household size`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST r THEN JUST (`s 2017 the figure for the area` (r's `the dollars`) `where the household lives`)
        IF `the household size` AT MOST 17 THEN
            CONSIDER `s 2017 the table row for size` 8
                WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
                WHEN JUST r8 THEN
                    JUST (  `s 2017 the figure for the area` (r8's `the dollars`) `where the household lives`
                          PLUS (`the household size` MINUS 8) TIMES (`s 2017 the figure for the area` `s 2017 the maximum allotment per additional person above 8, fiscal year 2027` `where the household lives`))
        OTHERWISE
            JUST (`s 2017 the figure for the area` `s 2017 the maximum monthly allotment for a household of 18 or more, fiscal year 2027` `where the household lives`)

